      "created_at": "2013-03-17T09:47:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Even an immortal can be taken out of actin. Some believe he's the big guy under the block in Demoralising Presence. It's entirely possible that Iron Legacy knows how powerful Haka is and has taken special measures to deal with him. If you're a global dictator, you have a lot of R&amp;D teams to figure out how to restrain anyvbody, even Haka. Plus, one of the quotes is \"I hit him as hard as I could and he did not flinch. I do not know this man.\" Haka, so it seems Iron Legacy is a match for Haak.</p>",
